# .cursor/ = IDE Config Working Copies Only

The `.cursor/` folder is for Cursor IDE to read. It is NOT for workspace tooling.

## What belongs in .cursor/

✅ `rules/` — EPHEMERAL COPY from `unified-trading-pm/cursor-rules/` (copied during setup, removed by cleanup before quickmerge)
✅ `plans/` — SYMLINK to `unified-trading-pm/plans/active/`
✅ `skills-cursor/` — Cursor skill files
✅ `workspace-configs/` — Cursor/VSCode workspace .json configs
✅ `plugins/` — Cursor plugin cache (auto-managed)

## What does NOT belong in .cursor/

❌ Scripts that do real work → `unified-trading-pm/scripts/`
❌ Execution plans or AI plans → `unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/`
❌ Manifests or config files → `unified-trading-pm/workspace-manifest.json`
❌ Bad-release annotations → `unified-trading-pm/manifest_warnings.yaml`
❌ Archives → `unified-trading-pm/archive/`
❌ Git operations or CI/CD logic

## Canonical Location (Repo) — Ephemeral vs Symlink

**Rules, .cursorrules, and AGENTS.md:** Ephemeral copies. Canonical source is PM. Copied during setup, removed by cleanup before quickmerge/PR.

**Plans:** Symlink into PM. Edits in `.cursor/plans/` modify git-tracked files directly.

| Location | Role |
|----------|------|
| `unified-trading-pm/cursor-rules/` | Canonical rules (git-tracked) |
| `unified-trading-pm/plans/active/` | Canonical plans (git-tracked) |
| `.cursor/rules/` | Ephemeral COPY from PM (removed before quickmerge) |
| `.cursorrules` | Ephemeral COPY from PM (workspace root) |
| `AGENTS.md` | Ephemeral COPY from PM (workspace root) |
| `.cursor/plans/` | Symlink → `unified-trading-pm/plans/active/` |

**Setup:** `bash scripts/setup-workspace.sh` (per-repo) calls `$PM_DEST/scripts/setup-workspace-from-manifest.sh`, which copies rules, .cursorrules, and AGENTS.md to `$WORKSPACE_ROOT`.

**Cleanup:** `$WORKSPACE_ROOT/.cleanup-cursor-rules.sh` (generated by setup) removes ephemeral files. Quickmerge runs it before Stage 5 (Create PR).

## How Rules and Plans Work

- **Rules, .cursorrules, AGENTS.md:** Ephemeral. Edit canonical source in `unified-trading-pm/`. The copy is for agents/CI to read during the session. Cleanup ensures ephemeral files are never committed.

- **Plans:** Symlink. Edits in `.cursor/plans/` modify git-tracked files in PM.

**To share rule changes with the team:**
```bash
cd unified-trading-pm
# Edit cursor-rules/ or AGENTS.md directly
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: add rule for X"
```

**To pull latest rules:** `cd unified-trading-pm && git pull`. Next setup run will copy the updated rules.

